## https://github.com/mgunyho/tere?ref=terminaltrove#keyboard-shortcuts
tere: Enter directory under cursor      | Rt / A-l/Dn / Etr / Spc
tere: Go to parent directory            | Lt / A-h/Up / Bksp
tere: Go to home directory              | ~ / C-Home / C-A-h
tere: Go to root directory              | / / A-r
tere: Move cursor up/down               | A-k/j / Up/Dn
tere: Move cursor up/down by one screen | PgUp/PgDn / C-u/d / A-u/d
tere: Move cursor to the top            | Home/End / A-g/A-S-g
tere: Erase a character from the search | Bksp
tere: Clear the search                  | Esc
tere: Toggle filter search              | A-f
tere: Change case sensitivity mode      | A-c
tere: Change gap search mode            | C-f
tere: Change sorting mode               | A-s
tere: Refresh current directory         | C-r
tere: Show help screen                  | ?
tere: Exit                              | Esc / A-q
tere: Enter directory and exit          | A-Etr / C-Spc
tere: Exit without changing directory   | C-c